          ],
          "pWrong": 0.64
        },
        {
          "id": "middle:Kassadin:Orianna:3",
          "text": "Swing with Nether Blade when you trade. It restores much more mana against champions, which helps you keep fighting.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Kassadin-W", "start": 11, "end": 23 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.03
        },
        {
          "id": "middle:Kassadin:Orianna:4",
          "text": "From level 6, Riftwalk into her to dodge her ultimate setup. Her Command: Shockwave only hits close to the Ball.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Kassadin-R", "start": 14, "end": 22 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Orianna-R", "start": 65, "end": 83 }
